BT /F1 10 Tf 14 TL 60 740 Td (Acme Corp travel policy, effective 1 April 2025) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Flights: economy class for flights under 6 hours. Business class is allowed for flights of 6 hours or more.) Tj T* (2. Hotels: the limit is 180 euros per night in Europe and 220 US dollars per night in North America.) Tj T* (3. Meals: the daily meal allowance is 55 euros. Alcohol is not reimbursed.) Tj T* (4. Claims: file expense claims within 30 days of the end of the trip.) Tj T* (   Receipts are required for any single item over 25 euros.) Tj T* (5. Approval: a line manager must approve every trip at least 14 days before departure.) Tj T* (6. Cars: rental cars need approval from the finance team.) Tj T* (   Travel in a personal car is paid at 0.30 euros per kilometre.) Tj T* (7. Contact: questions about this policy go to travel@acme.example.) Tj T* ET
